><p>想當成人影星？救護員自慰、尿液混入食物拍成片 逾十名同事不知情吃下肚</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:39:02.523023+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2117,"images":25,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:51.749119+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:37:36.794535+00:00","content_hash":"437f392da2e055a2e48e048440ed8519df93e7b4360b089ea8df9b3e48651095","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}